</code></pre></p> </li> <li> <p>✅ Ensure all numbers are positive:   <pre><code>const nums = [5, 10, 8];
const allPositive = nums.every(n =&gt; n &gt; 0);
console.log(allPositive); // true
</code></pre></p> </li> </ul>

